            "title": "周末一手成交跌6成僅32宗｜瑅海沽17伙呎價創新高｜太古城業主45年賺12.7倍",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">過去周末（21至22日）未有全新大型樓盤開售，一手成交回落至約32宗，較前一周約80宗減少60%。成交主要來自瑅海、薈淳及芊御等項目。其中瑅海單日沽出17伙，呎價創項目新高；薈淳及芊御則各售出3伙，共套現約3,945萬元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">二手市場交投反覆。綜合四大地產代理數據，十大屋苑周末（21至22日）錄6至10宗成交，按周個別發展。部分一手向隅客轉投二手市場，帶動個別屋苑交投回升，惟新盤接連部署推售，二手購買力仍受牽制。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-640f616f-1bec-33d7-9418-0f9743839c82-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">閱讀更多：</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"瑅海加價加推41伙海景兩房｜折實均呎24,328元高12.69%｜周六售100伙\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:瑅海加價加推41伙海景兩房｜折實均呎24,328元高12.69%25｜周六售100伙;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4teaIoR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">瑅海加價加推41伙海景兩房｜折實均呎24,328元高12.69%｜周六售100伙</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"薈淳加推均呎22,008元 同柱最多貴2.6%｜4伙貨尾加價最高4.54% 周六開售23伙\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:薈淳加推均呎22,008元 同柱最多貴2.6%25｜4伙貨尾加價最高4.54%25 周六開售23伙;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4zEEo01\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">薈淳加推均呎22,008元 同柱最多貴2.6%｜4伙貨尾加價最高4.54% 周六開售23伙</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>瑅海單日沽17伙 呎價3.12萬創項目新高</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">綜合媒體報道，信置牽頭發展的紅磡新盤瑅海，上周六（21日）展開新一輪銷售，單日售出17伙。其中，2座29樓A5室，實用面積505平方呎，以1,574.7萬元成交，呎價31,183元，創項目新高。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">瑅海開售約半個月，累計售出359伙，套現近33億元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇瑅海價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇瑅海價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/3V34o76\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇瑅海價單】</a></p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4dec931ed42685f64ddde3699cfc331ba305ab89af39581492a6e449163970a3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2Fcff891f73a6d6e6407b5ac116eb9dee9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>圖一：瑅海</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>薈淳周末沽3伙 套現逾2,027萬</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">宏安地產旗下黃大仙新盤薈淳過去周末（21至22日）售出3伙，套現約2,027.6萬元，當中開放式戶呎價高見22,772元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據成交記錄冊，售出單位包括2伙兩房戶及1伙開放式戶，實用面積202至376平方呎，成交價460萬至788.8萬元，實用呎價20,713至22,772元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">成交價最高為20樓A室兩房戶，實用面積376平方呎，以788.8萬元售出。呎價最高則為11樓K室開放式戶，實用面積202平方呎，成交價460萬元，呎價22,772元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇薈淳價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇薈淳價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4zHRM3B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇薈淳價單】</a></p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a44d0f41ee5b4029c93b90cbe6b99e68babf9fe05982a690156bb760101da8c4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2F83a3ea235c752e2c96136b680b220b7e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>圖二：薈淳</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>芊御周末沽3伙 兩房呎價高見1.73萬</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">新地旗下元朗錦田新盤芊御過去周末（21至22日）亦售出3伙，套現約1,917.38萬元，當中兩房戶呎價高見17,261元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">成交記錄冊顯示，3伙包括2伙兩房戶及1伙三房戶，實用面積376至498平方呎，成交價595.37萬至673.01萬元，實用呎價13,514至17,261元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">成交價最高為2座6樓L室三房戶，實用面積498平方呎，以673.01萬元售出，呎價13,514元。呎價最高則為1座2樓D室兩房戶，實用面積376平方呎，成交價649萬元，呎價17,261元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇芊御價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇芊御價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4tlrfHO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇芊御價單】</a></p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/daf2a3f6e81a428ccb1d798f17bf818f69101526e9b3c7f7b1c10d822f8b4386/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2F341c2a1e52b15cdfca43c832409ed511.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>圖三：芊御</strong></p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/df12d3179155c88eab3b849542dc4d9d207b37b6b9100c203ff7226269aeec79/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2Fea98f032fffac67ea279813a4f253b48.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>圖四：周末(11月21日 - 22日)一手新盤成交統計</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>十大屋苑周末成交6至10宗走勢不一 太古城業主持貨45年賺12.7倍</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">二手樓市交投反覆。四大地產代理數據顯示，過去周末（21至22日）十大屋苑成交量6至10宗，按周走勢不一。其中，美聯及中原分別錄10宗及9宗成交，按周升42.86%及12.5%，分別創12周及5周新高。利嘉閣錄7宗，按周跌30%；香港置業則錄6宗，按周維持不變，連續25周維持單位數成交。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美聯物業高級董事布少明表示，油塘新盤近日開價，市場收票反應熱烈，加上多個新盤準備推售，吸納部分購買力。不過，過去周末（21至22日）未有全新大型樓盤開售，一手成交主要集中於第四輪銷售的瑅海及其他貨尾盤。部分向隅客轉投二手市場，亦有買家趁年底前加快入市，帶動指標屋苑交投回升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">利嘉閣地產總裁廖偉強則認為，近期外圍局勢未明朗，中美貿易休戰期限將至，加上科技股受壓、股市波動，影響買家入市意欲。該行十大屋苑過去周末（21至22日）錄7宗成交，較前一周的10宗減少30%，重回單位數水平。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">二手市場亦錄得長情業主大幅獲利個案。<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"太古城\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:太古城;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4ARzrSE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">太古城</a>智星閣高層D室兩房戶，實用面積502平方呎，原叫價880萬元，獲同區用家以875萬元承接，減價5萬元，折合實用呎價17,430元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據悉，原業主於1981年以約64萬元購入單位，持貨約45年轉售，帳面獲利約811萬元，樓價升值約12.7倍。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇太古城新放盤】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇太古城新放盤】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4ARzrSE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇太古城新放盤】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">延伸閱讀: <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"瑅海\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:瑅海;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/new-properties/瑅海?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78683\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">瑅海</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"芊御\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:芊御;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/new-properties/芊御?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78683\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">芊御</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"薈淳\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:薈淳;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/new-properties/薈淳?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78683\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">薈淳</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"太古城\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:太古城;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/太古城-27352?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78683\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">太古城</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"黃大仙\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:黃大仙;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:cont